lowing best describes The High Line's purpose?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"A. To be a popular tourist attraction\",\n        \"B. To provide recreational space for locals only\",\n        \"C. To preserve urban history and nature\",\n        \"D. To offer a place to watch city lights at night\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
